---
layout: layouts/base.njk
lang: en
title: "Work — Anton Stasiuk"
description: "Three projects: abw.by, Beerzhevik, veloman.by. What it was, which decisions I made and what came out of it."
altUrl: /work/
---

<section class="l-section">
  <div class="l-container">
    <p class="hero__kicker">Work</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">Three projects, three different problems</h1>
    <p class="page-lead">
      A marketplace that had to move to a modern stack without pausing the product.
      A mobile PWA with live data. A store built from scratch, solo.
    </p>

    <div class="work-list work-list--large">
      {% for work in en.works %}
      <a class="work-item" href="/en/work/{{ work.slug }}/">
        <span class="work-item__title">{{ work.title }}</span>
        <span class="work-item__period">{{ work.period }}</span>
        <span class="work-item__desc">{{ en.cases[work.slug].summary }}</span>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
